Subject: [PATCH] rtc: s3c: keep H432B wake policy power-button-only
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [H432B appliance wake policy]

Use the RTC for wall-clock and elapsed sleep time, not automatic wake.
Other Samsung boards keep their existing alarm wake capability.

--- a/drivers/rtc/rtc-s3c.c
+++ b/drivers/rtc/rtc-s3c.c
@@ -459,1 +459,2 @@
-	device_init_wakeup(&pdev->dev, 1);
+	device_init_wakeup(&pdev->dev,
+		!of_machine_is_compatible("hims,braillesense-u2"));
